  "conservatism_rationale": "Both reflections converge on the same single entry (c8698dee) as the culprit, and the fix is a refinement of existing guidance rather than new guidance. Adding brand-new entries (content-gating rule, verification gate) from a single trace introduces more risk than updating the one entry that demonstrably misfired. The verification gate is noted as a future candidate but deferred pending more evidence.",
